===Etymology===
A British Indian variant of {{m|en|saraf}}, from {{der|en|ur|صراف|tr=sarrāf}} and {{der|en|fa|صراف|tr=sarâf}}, from {{der|en|ar|صَرَّاف}}. {{root|en|ar|ص ر ف}}

